    "body": "WRI co-created the Greenhouse Gas Protocol, the world's most widely used carbon accounting standard. It is now assessing how buyers could compare AI products on environmental performance. GSF is engaged in that assessment, contributing technical input on SCI for AI and on what makes results consistent and comparable across providers.",
